    "title": "[3.11] gh-144833: Fix use-after-free in SSL module when SSL_new() fails (GH-144843)",
    "user": {
      "login": "miss-islington",
      "id": 31488909,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDg4OTA5",
